            %p
              The resulting
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+quotient"} homotopy quotient
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi E
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                    %mi N
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo ⫽
                    %mi G
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (E/N)\sslash G
              is a compact flat orbifold.
          %p
            The following is the class of special cases of Example
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CompactFlatOrbifoldFromCrystallographicGroup"}
            for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/point+group"} point group
            being the
            = succeed "-" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/involution"} involution
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action"} action
            by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/reflection"} reflection
            at a point:
          #CoordinateReflectionOnNTorus.num_example
            %h6#example_2 Example
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coordinate+function"} coordinate
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/reflection"} reflection
                on
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-torus"} n-torus
            %p
              Let
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi 𝕋
                      %mi d
                    %mo ≔
                    %msup
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mi d
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                    %msup
                      %mi ℤ
                      %mi d
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{T}^d \coloneqq \mathbb{R}^d / \mathbb{Z}^d
              be the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-torus"} d-torus
              and consider the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action"} action
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cyclic+group"} cyclic group
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi ℤ
                      %mn 2
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{Z}_2
              by canonical
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coordinate+function"} coordinate
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/reflection"} reflection
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
                      %mtable
                        %mtr
